              "type": "_new-store-block",
              "name": "New Store",
              "settings": {
                "name": "Church Public Service",
                "desc": "<p>Church is your local skate shop hailing from our very own capital city, Canberra. Their store is tucked away in the Bailey's Corner building, where you can find records, clothing, skate goods and even play a game of pool.<br/><br/>What we like about Church is their community engagement, they get behind local artists and back creative events that bring people together.<br/><br/>You can now find a wide range of Crumpler goods at Church. When in Canberra be sure to pay a visit.<br/><br/>2/34 E Row, Canberra ACT 2601<br/><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/church.xyz/\" target=\"_blank\">@church.xyz</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.church.xyz/\" target=\"_blank\">www.church.xyz</a></p>"
